# TINYC_FV.SCRIPT -- the Tiny-C compiler (TINYC.CODE on CXPBUG.BLK, unit 9)
# compiling FV.TEXT, up to "Generating code" (without reclaimed memory the
# code generator then needs more stack than there is). Its recursive-descent
# parser calls into other segments far more than 64 frames deep: the native
# CXP bug of v1.83 (see verify/errtest/DEEPCXP.README.md). Validation Check 13.

WAIT "Command:"
TYPE "F"
WAIT "Filer:"
TYPE "P"
WAIT "Prefix"
TYPE "#9:\r"
WAIT "Filer:"
TYPE "Q"
WAIT "Command:"
TYPE "X"
WAIT "Execute what file?"
TYPE "TINYC\r"
WAIT "Compile what file?"
TYPE "/C FV\r"
WAIT "Compiling"
WAIT "Generating code"
